<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5216" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμετρ-ητος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
		also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			Pi.
			<u>I.</u>
			1.37
		</span></i>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>immeasurable,
				immense,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πένθος, πόνος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				19.512
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				23.249
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅλς</span> Pi.l.c.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀήρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Nu.</u>
					264
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταραχαί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Herc.</u>
					1251.18
				</span></i>
			; <i>inexhaustible,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στόμα Μούσης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					7.75
				</span></i>
			(Antip.), cf. Phth.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Sim.</u>
				1
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως, χρῆσθαι τῇ τιμῇ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					11.6.12
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>unnumbered, countless,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρετμοί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>El.</u>
					433
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>not measured,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλευρόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					2.1.23
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				29
			</span></i>. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ί,</span>
			Adv. of 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄμετρος, μέτρῳ ὕδωρ πίνοντες, ἀ. δὲ
					μᾶζαν ἔδοντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Zen.
					5.19
				</span></i>
			.</div>
